## **14. Challenges and risk management**

Every startup has operational risks. PrintHaus needs to prepare for them.

| Potential problem              | Proposed solution                            |
| ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------- |
| Primary printer is unavailable | Backup printing partner                      |
| Printer runs out of paper      | Maintain minimum supply levels               |
| Internet connection fails      | Backup internet and offline order records    |
| Student uploads the wrong file | File preview and confirmation before payment |
| Printing error                 | Quality control and reprint policy           |
| Delayed orders                 | Accurate status updates                      |
| Student doesn't collect        | Reminders and collection deadlines           |
| Order goes missing             | Unique order IDs and collection records      |
| Unauthorised collection        | Verify the student's collection code         |
| Documents exposed              | Restricted file access and secure storage    |

Because documents may contain personal information, PrintHaus should have a clear privacy policy. Files should only be accessible to authorised staff and deleted according to a defined retention schedule.

